form the campus community about campus security procedures and crime prevention. An electronic copy of the Annual Security Report (ASR) can be accessed at the following link:  https://cps.sou.edu/clery-act-annual-security-report/ .  A physical copy of the ASR is available at no charge upon request. To request a copy, please visit the Office of the General Counsel located in Churchill Hall, 1250 Siskiyou Boulevard, Ashland, Oregon 97520.  For more information, call 541-552-7095, or email  clerycoordinator@sou.edu ."
